{
  "_note": "模板（脱敏后随仓分发）：<REPO_ROOT> = 本仓检出目录，<MDCG_ROOT> = 认知图库根，<PID_A> = 须先复算再填入的常驻 MCP server PID（用 scripts/mdcg_stale_servers.py list 的输出挑选，禁复用历史 PID）。运行前须把全部占位符替换为实际绝对路径 / 实际 PID。三个被调脚本均已参数化——mdcg_stale_servers.py 经 __file__ 推导仓根 + 读环境变量 MDCG_ROOT；_mdcg_lib_backup.py / _mdcg_reindex_code.py 走 --root/--repo 显式入参；mdcg_verify_render_meta.py 经 __file__ 推导仓根 + 读环境变量 MDCG_ROOT（缺失即 exit 2）。**首步 restart_resident_server 为依据纪律「改 md_cg/*.py 后必须重启常驻 MCP server」而固化**：Python 进程启动即固化模块导入，不重启则其后续 index 会用旧代际 render 覆盖重建成果（2026-09-19 实证：常驻进程于版本戳落地后仍写出无 render_version 的节点）；它同时是 preflight_no_stale 能通过的**因果前提**——先处置污染源、再让守卫复算，顺序不可颠倒。",
  "model": "cmd",
  "user_prompt": "md_cg+compiler 代码节点全量重建（常驻 server 重启 → 前置污染源守卫 → 备份 → 双域全量重切 → 过期代清退 → 悬空清退 → 机械验收 → 稳定期复测）；验收判据 meta_indep == total 且 old_synth == 0 且 active_old_synth == 0 且 versioned == total（code_ref.render_version >= codeindex.RENDER_VERSION：代际判据，取代纯形态启发式）",
  "cwd": "<REPO_ROOT>",
  "timeout_s": 1800,
  "timeout_step_s": 1800,
  "fail_fast": true,
  "env": {
    "PYTHONUTF8": "1",
    "MDCG_ROOT": "<MDCG_ROOT>"
  },
  "commands": [
    {
      "label": "restart_resident_server",
      "command": ["python", "-X", "utf8", "scripts/mdcg_stale_servers.py",
                  "kill", "--pid", "<PID_A>"]
    },
    {
      "label": "wait_reconnect_20s",
      "command": ["python", "-X", "utf8", "-c", "import time; time.sleep(20)"]
    },
    {
      "label": "preflight_no_stale",
      "command": ["python", "-X", "utf8", "scripts/mdcg_stale_servers.py",
                  "list", "--fail-on-stale"]
    },
    {
      "label": "backup",
      "command": ["python", "-X", "utf8", "scripts/_mdcg_lib_backup.py",
                  "--root", "<MDCG_ROOT>"]
    },
    {
      "label": "rebuild_md_cg",
      "command": ["python", "-X", "utf8", "scripts/_mdcg_reindex_code.py",
                  "--root", "<MDCG_ROOT>",
                  "--repo", "<REPO_ROOT>",
                  "--domain", "md_cg",
                  "--incremental", "0",
                  "--prune", "1",
                  "--dangling", "1",
                  "--max-check", "20000",
                  "--max-files", "4000",
                  "--max-items", "80000"]
    },
    {
      "label": "rebuild_compiler",
      "command": ["python", "-X", "utf8", "scripts/_mdcg_reindex_code.py",
                  "--root", "<MDCG_ROOT>",
                  "--repo", "<REPO_ROOT>",
                  "--domain", "compiler",
                  "--incremental", "0",
                  "--prune", "1",
                  "--dangling", "1",
                  "--max-check", "20000",
                  "--max-files", "4000",
                  "--max-items", "80000"]
    },
    {
      "label": "verify_meta_indep",
      "command": ["python", "-X", "utf8", "scripts/mdcg_verify_render_meta.py"]
    },
    {
      "label": "settle_20s",
      "command": ["python", "-X", "utf8", "-c", "import time; time.sleep(20)"]
    },
    {
      "label": "verify_meta_indep_recheck",
      "command": ["python", "-X", "utf8", "scripts/mdcg_verify_render_meta.py"]
    },
    {
      "label": "cogmap_rebuild",
      "command": ["python", "-X", "utf8", "scripts/cogmap_sync.py", "build"]
    },
    {
      "label": "cogmap_check",
      "command": ["python", "-X", "utf8", "scripts/cogmap_sync.py", "check"]
    }
  ],
  "expect_stdout_contains": ["\"ok\": true", "\"old_synth\": 0",
                             "\"active_old_synth\": 0", "\"render_version_dist\""]
}
